Cette application vous est présentée par l'équipe du projet Chants d'Espérance audio. La version Vocal Pro  contient 5 recueils d'hymnes et leurs paroles, qui sont les suivants: Chants d'Espérance Français et Kreyòl, Melodies Joyeuses Francais / Kreyòl et Haiti Chante Avec Radio Lumiere.  Nous pouvons maintenant chanter hymnes inconnus en écoutant à la musique jouée. Une fois que le bouton de lecture de la première chanson est enfoncé, l'application jouera automatiquement le reste des hymnes pour vous; facile à utiliser; l'objectif est de vous aider à apprendre toutes les chansons écrites par les compositeurs avec une sauvegarde instrumentale complète pour chaque chanson. Cette application est idéale pour le service de louange et d'adoration, la dévotion personnelle, les mariages, les réceptions de mariage, la marche dans le parc et les occasions spéciales où une atmosphère spirituelle nécessite des instruments spirituels;

English: 
This app is brought to you by Chants d'Espérance Audio Project Team. The Vocal Pro Version of the missing companion to the Chants D'esperance hymns book contains 5 hymn books and their lyrics, which are the following:  Chants d'Esperance Français and Kreyòl, Mélodies Joyeuses Francais/Creole and Haiti Chante Avec Radio Lumiere. We also provide the text each book. We can now sing along while listening to the music playing and to the voice for each song. Once the play button on the first song is pushed, the app will automatically play the rest of the hymns for you; easy to use; the goal is to help you learn all the songs as written by the composers with a full instrumental back up for each song. This app is ideal for personal devotion, weddings, wedding receptions, walking in the park, and special occasions where a spiritual atmosphere requires spiritual instrumentals;

SunVox is one of the most powerful music creation tools for iOS. It is a small and fast cross-platform modular synthesizer with pattern based sequencer (tracker).

[ Key features ]
• Modular interface.
• Powerful microtonal sequencer.
• Highly optimized synth algorithms.
• Support of 16/24/32bit WAV, AIFF and XI samples.
• XM (FastTracker) and MOD (ProTracker, OctaMED) import.
• Multitrack WAV export.
• MIDI import/export.
• MIDI IN/OUT.
• Mic/Line recording (using the Sampler).
• Audio Unit Extension (AUv3 instrument/effect), Audiobus.
• Generative music features: random selection of notes, random values of controllers, probability effects.
• It's possible to use SunVox engine in your own applications using the free library for developers.
• It is also available for other systems (see the site).

[ Brief instruction ]
The main menu - button with the SunVox icon in the upper left corner of the screen.
To connect one module (source) to another (destination): first touch on the source, second touch on the destination.

Official SunVox homepage, user manual, video tutorials: 
https://warmplace.ru/soft/sunvox

SunVox music:
https://warmplace.ru/soft/sunvox/#music

Found a bug? Have some questions? Just write me directly: nightradio@gmail.com
The answer comes immediately!

[ Built-in synthesizers & effects ]
• Generators;
• DrumSynth with 120 unique synthetic drum sounds;
• FM synthesizer;
• Multisample instrument;
• SpectraVoice (FFT-based synthesizer for warm atmospheric sounds);
• Side Chain Compressor;
• Distortion;
• Echo & Reverb;
• Equalizer & Filters;
• Flanger;
• Loop (for glitch effects);
• Vocal Filter (for human voice simulation);
• Vorbis Player;
• WaveShaper;
• Pitch Detector;
• Pitch Shifter;
• and more ...

[ Jordan Rudess about this app ]
Sunvox is a serious music application. I am personally running it on my iphone. In the overcrowded world of music apps, Sunvox stands out as both unique and powerful. If you are a musician and own an iphone, you owe it to yourself to try this amazing application!
